seforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mickey-joes-relatively-improved-default\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p><p>步驟 2. 由 FreshLX 下載「Fresh Animations」 - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p><p>步驟 3. 取得此附加包</p><p>步驟 4. 如下圖所示安裝資源包：</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AB1YR7I.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"432\"></p><p><del>步驟 5. 掃描我的 QR 碼</del></p><p>步驟 6. 盡情享受 Barely Default × Fresh Animations！</p><hr><h3>在我的 YouTube 頻道上的預覽影片 👍</h3><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:638px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pqqLxtn983g?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"638\" height=\"375\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h3>☝ Barely Default x Fresh Animations 預告片！☝</h3><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qwA8zsSvjpE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:636px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tz-rY-h0RDY?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"636\" height=\"370\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:638px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bF-Hu2xXpKg?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&amp;index=1\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WXs2wUiY6gw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CD4IQ7xho8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rgiy0jrXzDA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e-09ofC8Tn8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><hr><p>非常感謝 <strong>FreshLX</strong> 允許我創建此附加包！Fresh Animations 絕對完美，能與他合作是我的榮幸。</p><p>這次合作是社群高度要求的，所以我們一起完成了這項工作。</p><p>請查看 FreshLX 的線上資訊：</p><p>💰 支持他的作品 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffreshlx\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-Fi.com/FreshLX</a></p><p>🐦 推特 - <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fresh_LX\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter.com/Fresh_LX</a></p><p>🌎 在 PMC 上的作品 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fFreshLX%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.PlanetMinecraft.com/member/FreshLX/</a></p><hr><p>最後但同樣重要的是 MJ 的社群媒體：</p><p>💲 資助油錢 - <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon.com/MushirMickeyJoe</a></p><p>🦜 最新消息 - <a href=\"https://twitter.com/MushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter.com/MushirMickeyJoe</a></p><p>📷 IG - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fMushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Instagram.com/MushirMickeyJoe</a></p><p>感謝遊玩！</p><p>特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ewan Howell</a>，他總是在 Barely Default 功能出問題時願意幫助我 &lt;3</p><p>如果你還在看這段文字，請到我的 YouTube 頻道看看，我承諾每週都會更新一集 MJ Trips，直到永遠 -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@MushirMickeyJoe</a></p>",
